msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey, Kiryu-san. I can take ya over to the Dragon Palace. Do you want a "
"ride?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "All right, enjoy the ride!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"No worries! I'm usually hanging out around here. Come see me if you feel up "
"to heading over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "This is it."
msgstr "Ci siamo."

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Wait a minute..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Oh, you already know the place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Yeah, I've been here before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"That'll make my job easier, then. Everyone who knows of the Kamurocho "
"underground should visit this place at least once, to see its gambling halls"
" and dojo..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "The Dragon Palace!"
msgstr "Dragon Palace."

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"I knew they ran a gambling hall in the Dragon Palace, but this is the first "
"I'm hearing about a dojo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"Well! The dojo's still pretty new to the Palace. It was only set up about a "
"year ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Some old martial artist named Komaki teaches people new moves there. At "
"least, when he feels like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"We get all sorts of strong-lookin' guys going straight past the gambling "
"hall and beelining for the dojo. Probably hoping to learn something new."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "You said his name's Komaki? Wonder if it's the same Komaki I know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "The only people allowed in are the ones we regulars let in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"We got lotsa games here, from shogi to your usual gambling fare. Best thing "
"is, cops can't lay a finger on us, on account of our complicated layout."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Well, go on! Get out there and start havin' fun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san! Want a ride?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Off we go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"All right... I was hopin' to repay you, but I guess now's not the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Come back later if you change your mind, all right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Damn, you're tough..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Any more trash I need to clean up? I could do this all day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Dammit! You ain't seen the last of us, old man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "You saved my shell! Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "My name's Kamekichi. Mind if I ask your name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "It's Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Won't be forgettin' that name anytime soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"Well, I gotta repay you for saving a wretch like me. Come with me for a hot "
"minute, I'll show you somethin' interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Here, get in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Where are you going to take me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"Hold on, you're taking me there in this? You sure it's not going to explode "
"the second you take it out of park?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"Of course not! This here's the Hyper Turtle! It can go from zero to thirty "
"kilometers an hour in under a minute!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "(I'm getting some serious déjà vu here...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Well? You gonna come along for a ride?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Off we go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
